<title>USA: Merrill Lynch may issue $350 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch may issue $350 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co is expected to tap the market with a $350 million debt offering, high-grade syndicate sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Aa3/AA-minus rated deal is expected to consist of a 10-year maturity, sources said.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch will lead manage the deal, they added.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the offering.</p>
<p>((--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675))</p>
